{"id":1338,"date":"2020-10-08T11:17:49","date_gmt":"2020-10-08T11:17:49","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=1338"},"modified":"2021-06-07T06:21:11","modified_gmt":"2021-06-07T06:21:11","slug":"analyza-netkanych-textilii","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/analyza-netkanych-textilii\/","title":{"rendered":"Anal\u00fdza netkan\u00fdch text\u00edli\u00ed"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"1338\" class=\"elementor elementor-1338\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-6262a9d elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"6262a9d\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-a15af58\" data-id=\"a15af58\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0c81b99 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0c81b99\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Morfologick\u00e1 a chemick\u00e1 charakterizace modern\u00edch netkan\u00fdch textili\u00ed pomoc\u00ed skenovac\u00ed elektronov\u00e9 (SEM) a infra\u010derven\u00e9 (FT-IR) mikroskopie.<\/p><p>Netkan\u00e9 textilie jsou jedn\u00edm z nejrychleji rostouc\u00edch segment\u016f modern\u00edho textiln\u00edho pr\u016fmyslu a v dne\u0161n\u00ed dob\u011b u\u017e p\u0159edstavuj\u00ed v\u00fdznamnou \u010d\u00e1st celkov\u00e9 produkce. Na za\u010d\u00e1tku 21. stolet\u00ed byla t\u00e9m\u011b\u0159 polovina vyr\u00e1b\u011bn\u00fdch netkan\u00fdch textili\u00ed z polypropylenov\u00fdch, \u010dtvrtina z polyesterov\u00fdch a desetina z visk\u00f3zov\u00fdch vl\u00e1ken. V\u00edcevrstv\u00e9 netkan\u00e9 kompozitn\u00ed textilie, lamin\u00e1ty a trojrozm\u011brn\u00e9 netkan\u00e9 textilie se komer\u010dn\u011b vyr\u00e1b\u011bj\u00ed a pou\u017e\u00edvaj\u00ed v \u0161irok\u00e9 \u0161k\u00e1le pr\u016fmyslov\u00e9ho in\u017een\u00fdrstv\u00ed (izolace, automobilov\u00fd pr\u016fmysl atd.), ale zejm\u00e9na jako spot\u0159ebn\u00ed, zdravotnick\u00e9 a hygienick\u00e9 v\u00fdrobky. Nap\u0159\u00edklad jedn\u00edm z aktu\u00e1ln\u011b z\u00e1sadn\u00edch produkt\u016f vyr\u00e1b\u011bn\u00fdch z netkan\u00fdch textili\u00ed jsou \u00fastn\u00ed rou\u0161ky. Slo\u017eitost t\u011bchto vl\u00e1knit\u00fdch materi\u00e1l\u016f vy\u017eaduje pou\u017eit\u00ed kombinace v\u00edce analytick\u00fdch technik pro jejich \u00faplnou charakterizaci.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b4ff7d4 dce_masking-none elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"b4ff7d4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"583\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/75639d41-1024x746.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1342\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/75639d41-1024x746.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/75639d41-300x219.jpg 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/75639d41-768x559.jpg 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/75639d41.jpg 1149w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-99461a0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"99461a0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Skenovac\u00ed elektronov\u00e1 mikroskopie (SEM) a infra\u010derven\u00e1 (FT-IR) mikroskopie jsou dv\u011b \u0161iroce pou\u017e\u00edvan\u00e9 mikroskopick\u00e9 techniky pro charakterizace netkan\u00fdch materi\u00e1l\u016f. Technika SEM nab\u00edz\u00ed velmi vysok\u00e9 prostorov\u00e9 rozli\u0161en\u00ed (v m\u011b\u0159\u00edtku nanometr\u016f) z\u00edskan\u00fdch obr\u00e1zk\u016f ne\u017e jin\u00e9 optick\u00e9 techniky. Poskytuje obr\u00e1zky vl\u00e1ken s charakteristick\u00fdm trojrozm\u011brn\u00fdm vzhledem prosp\u011b\u0161n\u00fdm pro pochopen\u00ed struktury v\u00fdrobk\u016f. Rozd\u00edl v chemick\u00e9m slo\u017een\u00ed se ov\u0161em projevuje v SEM obr\u00e1zc\u00edch pouze kontrastem, p\u0159esnou chemickou identitu nelze touto mikroskopickou technikou snadno ur\u010dit. A zde p\u0159ich\u00e1z\u00ed do akce FT-IR mikroskopie. Tato vysoce chemicky selektivn\u00ed metoda velmi snadno a rychle identifikuje chemick\u00e9 slo\u017een\u00ed vl\u00e1ken (i kombinovan\u00fdch) s omezen\u00edm tzv. difrak\u010dn\u00edm limitem infra\u010derven\u00e9ho sv\u011btla kolem 10 mikrometr\u016f. Modern\u00ed FT-IR mikroskopy jako nap\u0159.\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/mikroskop-in10\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Nicolet iN10<\/a>\u00a0a\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/mikroskop-in10-mx\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Nicolet iN10 MX<\/a>\u00a0jsou vybaveny extenzivn\u00edmi knihovnami polymern\u00edch a p\u0159\u00edrodn\u00edch materi\u00e1l\u016f pro rychlou identifikaci a p\u0159\u00edpadn\u011b i kvantifikaci jednotliv\u00fdch vl\u00e1ken. \u0158\u00edd\u00edc\u00ed software SEM a FT-IR mikroskop\u016f umo\u017e\u0148uje tak\u00e9 tvorbu tzv. korela\u010dn\u00edch \u201echemical images\u201c, ze kter\u00fdch lze velmi snadno vy\u010d\u00edst komplexn\u00ed strukturu dan\u00e9 netkan\u00e9 textilie.<\/p><p>V\u00edce informac\u00ed naleznete zde:\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2020\/10\/AN53080-nonwoven-fiber-analysis-sem-ftir-microscopy.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Morphological and chemical characterization of a non-woven fiber using electron and infrared microscopy<\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Morfologick\u00e1 a chemick\u00e1 charakterizace modern\u00edch netkan\u00fdch textili\u00ed pomoc\u00ed skenovac\u00ed elektronov\u00e9 (SEM) a infra\u010derven\u00e9 (FT-IR) mikroskopie. Netkan\u00e9 textilie jsou jedn\u00edm z nejrychleji rostouc\u00edch segment\u016f modern\u00edho textiln\u00edho pr\u016fmyslu a v dne\u0161n\u00ed dob\u011b u\u017e p\u0159edstavuj\u00ed v\u00fdznamnou \u010d\u00e1st celkov\u00e9 produkce. Na za\u010d\u00e1tku 21. stolet\u00ed byla t\u00e9m\u011b\u0159 polovina vyr\u00e1b\u011bn\u00fdch netkan\u00fdch textili\u00ed z polypropylenov\u00fdch, \u010dtvrtina z polyesterov\u00fdch a desetina z visk\u00f3zov\u00fdch [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":1346,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[76,9],"tags":[79],"class_list":["post-1338","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-76","category-novinky","tag-79"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v26.8 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Anal\u00fdza netkan\u00fdch text\u00edli\u00ed - Nicolet CZ<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/analyza-netkanych-textilii\/\" \/>\n<meta prop